    "detailed_description": "<strong>Story background:</strong><br><br>The Magicians Association is a professional organization for all magicians, recognized by the vast majority of people from the world.<br>Every magician registered in the association will have a magician level certified by the association, starting from [Level 1], a total of five levels. To upgrade the magician level, you need to participate in the assessment prepared by the association.<br><br>Today is the day of [Tier 3] Magician\u2014Yiyou, participating in the [Tier 4] assessment. Different from the previous few times, the [Level 4] assessments are all personal assessments. Whether Yiyou can pass this assessment, she herself is a little uneasy.<br><br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br><br>The puzzle-solving game contains elements such as calculation, avoidance, and mechanism. The key to solving puzzles lies in the control of information.<br>The player will operate Yiyou and participate in this assessment with her.<br>There are many levels in the assessment, and the final score is determined according to the degree of passing each level. There are three endings.",
